                                "sense_id": "6b62c7c5-bcb3-381b-83c8-49fa2ca3f9cb",
                                "text": "By prohibiting all his Majesty's subjects from dealing in tobacco, except with a single company, one third of the exports of the United States are rendered uncommerciable here."
                            },
